  "content": "\n\n<h2><strong>⚠️ 資訊：</strong></h2>\n<p>本模組是 <strong>補充內容</strong>，並非附加模組，專為 <span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong><em>Ribbits</em></strong></span> 模組設計，由&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">joosh_7889。</a></strong><br>它可獨立遊玩，但若與原版 Ribbits 模組搭配使用，也能進一步擴展遊戲體驗。</p>\n<p>若您有任何建議、需要協助或想回報問題，歡迎加入 <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://discord.gg/WyDbuzMVKZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a></strong></span> 與我聯繫。</p>\n<h2><strong>📜 說明：</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Useful Ribbits</strong> 為您的 Minecraft 世界增添了多種實用或裝飾性的<strong>Ribbits</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>廚師 Ribbit</strong>：能從 <strong>Ribbit 箱子</strong> 中取出肉類與魚類，並自動在煙燻爐中烹調。</li>\n<li><strong>農民 Ribbit</strong>：能從 <strong>Ribbit 箱子</strong> 中取出種子，並自動播種於耕地方塊上。</li>\n<li><strong>礦工 Ribbit</strong>：目前尚未有特別功能。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1328119/description_df31dd0d-1cac-4101-afb7-78372d8f2380.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"810\" height=\"281\"></p>\n<h2><strong>⚒️ 合成配方：</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Ribbit 床：<br></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在有 <span style=\"color:#169179\"><strong>Ribbits</strong></span> 模組的情況下：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;在沒有 <span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>Ribbits</strong></span> 模組的情況下：<strong><strong><br></strong></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1328119/description_8cb7d4b3-4199-4f68-8fd3-e725ea27c71c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1328119/description_6c0c2ff5-b05a-42c8-986a-e93a34a3acfd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"><br><br></li>\n<li><strong>Ribbit 箱子：<br></strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1328119/description_739b9987-7fa1-4e79-849f-b5485cb3cfeb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>🌍 <strong>支援語言：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>英文 (en_us) <em>-預設</em></li>\n<li>英文 (en_gb)</li>\n<li>法文 (fr_fr)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><strong>📝 意見回饋與錯誤回報：</strong></h2>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;非常歡迎您提供任何意見回饋！<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;若遇到任何錯誤或問題，請隨時回報。&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp;也非常歡迎提出建議與新點子！</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;社群交流、技術支援、建議與錯誤回報： <strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WyDbuzMVKZ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/WyDbuzMVKZ</a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>如果您想支持我： <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252frogue_one12\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/rogue_one12</a></strong></p>",
